At a quarter past nine, the closer canceled. Yesenia and her violin were
stuck on the 2 train between stations, which is the kind of problem the
2 train enjoys. Mr. Rodríguez stood in the middle of the floor with a
clipboard and the face of a man watching a cake fall. Then he turned,
slowly, toward the back, where Manny was eating a pastelito and not
bothering anyone.
   “Manuel.”
   “I’m not on the list.”
   “You are the list.”



